 Anduril is looking for a Director of Facilities to lead facilities management for Arsenal-1, our manufacturing campus outside Columbus, Ohio. The site spans roughly 1.5 million square feet of office, manufacturing, and warehouse space today and will grow to more than 5 million square feet. The candidate will be responsible for managing all aspects of campus facility operations, including building systems and preventive maintenance, workplace services, and construction projects. They will lead a team of professionals and ensure that all facilities support the company's strategic objectives and operational needs. We seek a leader with a strategic mindset, operational excellence, and a commitment to fostering a vibrant and effective workplace.&nbsp;



 WHAT YOU’LL DO&nbsp;


 Own day-to-day facilities management of the Arsenal-1 campus — building systems (HVAC, electrical, plumbing, compressed air, life safety), janitorial, grounds, and utilities — ensuring a seamless experience for employees and visitors.&nbsp;

