 Coordinate with cross-functional teams for space planning, utilization, and optimization.&nbsp;

 Promote a culture of excellence and continuous improvement.&nbsp;

 Support projects including space planning, maintenance, and facility upgrades.&nbsp;

 Ensure campus services such as security, cleaning, catering, and transportation meet the highest standards.&nbsp;

 Demonstrate both high ownership and low ego, approaching everything with strong outcome orientation and high humility.&nbsp;


