 The Finance PMO drives the strategic initiatives that scale Finance &amp; Accounting at Anduril. We own end-to-end delivery of system implementations, process transformation, and high-priority programs that directly support the company’s growth objectives . Our work spans Finance &amp; Accounting, Corporate Technology, Business Operations, and Supply Chain — making cross-functional coordination a baseline expectation, not a stretch goal.&nbsp; 

 ABOUT THE JOB

 We are looking for a Program Manager to join our Finance PMO Team. You will lead the delivery of multi-workstream programs across the Finance &amp; Accounting organization, coordinating across related projects to drive integrated outcomes. You will operate with minimal to no oversight, demonstrating expertise in program delivery and beginning to contribute to broader strategic priorities within the Finance PMO. You will take ambiguous mandates and turn them into structured programs with clear milestones, owners, and delivery timelines. You will apply the right methodology to the right problem — driving structured, predictive delivery for system implem entations and compliance-driven initiatives while leveraging agile approaches for iterative work where requirements are still taking shape. You will identify risks early, manage cross-functional dependencies, and make the judgment calls that keep programs moving. The right person for this role has a high sense of ownership, has delivered programs across complex stakeholder environments, and brings the organizational discipline to manage multiple concurrent workstreams without losing sight of the details. Su ccess in this position comes from a dynamic mindset, strong analytical skills, and an operating posture that balances speed with rigor — especially in environments with evolving requirements and high mission impact. 

 WHAT YOU’LL DO


 Lead end-to-end delivery of multi-workstream programs across the Finance &amp; Accounting organization from intake through hypercare — driving program strategy, requirements gathering, design, build, testing, production deployment, change management, and post-launch stabilization. You will drive programs end-to-end using the right mix of predictive and agile methodologies to achieve mission objectives and identified outcomes. &nbsp; 

