 10+ years of experience in project / program management, with significant time spent in finance, accounting, and/or technology environments. &nbsp; 

 Demonstrated expertise managing multi-workstream programs in environments where requirements evolve and stakeholders span multiple functions. You have established program governance and reporting frameworks — not just operated within existing ones. &nbsp; 

 Deep familiarity with financial systems (ERP, EPM, BI platforms) and the organizational change that accompanies their implementation. &nbsp; 

 Strong communication skills with the ability to translate program complexity into clear, decision-ready narratives for leadership and manage through influence across technical and non-technical stakeholders. &nbsp; 

 Hands-on experience leveraging Jira as the primary program management platform — from initiative tracking through task-level execution — to drive visibility, transparency, and alignment across partners and stakeholders. Experience using Confluence to support reporting and documentation. &nbsp; 

 PMP, PMI-ACP, or equivalent certification preferred. &nbsp; 

