 Experience in Mechanical design for loads, stress,&nbsp;mounting&nbsp;and attachment fabrication.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; 



 Hands-on prototyping (soldering, board assembly, harnessing)&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; 



 Experience with any: controls/actuation, robotics, and or motor/servo drive systems (BLDC/brushed motor controller design and servo control systems)&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; 



 Familiarity with microcontrollers, power&nbsp;conversion&nbsp;and system integration&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; 



