 Support PCBA thermal analysis and electronic component thermal management &nbsp; 



 Own the development, planning, and execution of unit and system thermal vacuum, thermal balance, and thermal cycle tests &nbsp; 



 Develop internal tools to improve the effectiveness and efficiency of analysis &nbsp; 



 Develop, prepare, and execute thermal tests to inform analysis and reduce risk on key hardware assemblies &nbsp; 


 &nbsp;

